1          /*===============================================================================
2           * sdtm_fulldomain_bug_nolabel.sas - Bug regression: SUPP QVAL without a label
3           *===============================================================================
4           * Macro under test : %sdtm_fulldomain
5           * Expected         : full domain built even when QVAL carries no label
6           * Status           : FIXED 2026-10-29 - the merge now drops _LABEL_
7           *                    conditionally (%var_coexist).  Kept as a regression test;
8           *                    run_all reports FIXED while the test passes.
9           * Original defect  : "2. Core processing" merged with
10          *                    sdtm_fulldomain1(drop=_name_ _label_); PROC TRANSPOSE only
11          *                    creates _LABEL_ when the transposed variable (QVAL) has a
12          *                    label.  Without one, the DROP list is invalid:
13          *                      ERROR: Variable _label_ in DROP/KEEP/RENAME list never
14          *                             referenced
15          *                    SAS stops the DATA step and OUT is left with 0 observations
16          *                    (and WORK.SDTM_FULLDOMAIN1 is not deleted).
17          * Fix              : drop _NAME_/_LABEL_ conditionally, e.g.
18          *                    %if %var_exist(data=sdtm_fulldomain1,var=_LABEL_) %then ...
19          *                    or use (drop=_name_ _label_ keep=...) equivalent built
20          *                    from the actual metadata.
21          * Test passes when  the defect is fixed (run_all then reports FIXED).
22          *============================================================================*/
